      "outlet": "MLB Pipeline",
      "text": "Aaron Ashby this postseason: 8 G, 15 2/3 IP, 5 H, 0 R, 3 BB, 17 K He's converted all three of his save opportunities, each of which have been at least 1 2/3 innings long.",
      "likes": 23,
      "reposts": 4,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-10-25T03:50:41.067Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:bdxjovzqrf4q66ptu3dplmeb/app.bsky.feed.post/3myocizt42k2g",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "アーロン・アシュビー、今ポストシーズンの成績：8試合、15回2/3、5被安打、無失点、3四球、17奪三振。セーブ機会3度すべてを成功させ、どれも1回2/3以上を投げ切っている。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "afkostka.bsky.social",
