      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "I don't think this counts as that close.",
          "likes": 10,
          "author": "walkingtaako.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "For what it’s worth (absolutely nothing), I think he offered",
          "likes": 6,
          "author": "afkostka.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "I felt he checked.",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "prosec34.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "Not a fan of either team, didn’t look all that close. He stops a fair bit back of halfway, doesn’t break his wrists. And that’s ignoring that even the side view is slightly behind the batter and perspective will skew it forward. I think that’s called a non-swing 90% of the time.",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "buddytheelf.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "横からのアングル。際どい判定で、どちらのファンが見るかによって見え方が変わりそう。"
